SUMMARY:Candlelight: Tribute to Fleetwood Mac at Sebastiani Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Candlelight: Tribute to Fleetwood Mac brings the band's iconic harmonies to Sebastiani Theatre for a glowing\, intimate evening of live music in downtown Sonoma. Expect faithful arrangements and soaring crescendos from tender ballads to anthems like "Dreams" and "Go Your Own Way\," staged in the historic theatre's warm\, candlelit setting.  Saturday\, April 18\, 2026 at 7:00pm. Tickets $100.      Event Tickets  Visit Website  
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/candlelight-tribute-to-fleetwood-mac-at-sebastiani-theatre/
