SUMMARY:B-Earth Day Bash at Little Saint
DESCRIPTION:Little Saint turns 4\, and they're throwing a B-Earth Day Bash in Healdsburg. DJ Saint Rose Disco brings the dance floor to life\, and every guest gets a complimentary pour. The evening also spotlights Raen\, Little Saint's April Featured Winery\, and their organic Monarch Challenge Rosé. Saturday\, April 18\, 2026 from 8:00pm onward. Cover is $10 at the door\, free for Little Saint dinner guests. Full bar with wine\, cocktails\, and non-alcoholic options.      Event Tickets  Visit Website  
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/b-earth-day-bash-at-little-saint/
LOCATION:25 North St, , Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Dining,Food & Wine,Holiday,Sonoma County
